    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d897">

                <pb facs="0937" n="817" xml:id="pg817"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Peirce states that the Government of the United States will do everything
                    possible to preserve the territorial integrity and the sovereignty of China in
                    the coming peace negotiations, but the United States is only endeavoring to
                    bring the two countries together, and will have nothing to do with the actual
                    negotiations themselves.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
